  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sufficient, competent and motivated nurses and midwives in Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the National Organisation of Nurses and Midwives of Malawi in various areas such as organisational development; membership recruitment, retainment and services; and advocacy, lobbying and research in order to contribute to the gap of sufficient, competent and motivated nurses and midwives in Malawi</narrative>
  </description>
